• Construction of cycle paths, roads and car parks;
• Placing environmental pavements;
• Placing roundabouts and refuges;
• Placing vowels and paving stones;


As a ROAD WORKER in WESTENDE you can find yourself in the following

• You speak Englisch or Dutch;
• You are handy and like to work outside;
• No study requirements - motivation is what we need!

For our client located in WESTENDE, we are looking for a CONSTRUCTION MACHINERY MECHANIC.

Our client is a well-established contractor carrying out projects for both the public and private sectors.

As a CONSTRUCTION MACHINERY MECHANIC in WESTENDE, your responsibilities will include:

• Performing inspections and preventive maintenance on construction machinery and trucks;
• Repairing defects and carrying out corrective maintenance on construction machinery and trucks;
• Working both in the workshop and on-site;
• Troubleshooting and resolving electrical, hydraulic and mechanical issues;
• Contributing ideas and suggestions to improve the efficiency and performance of the machinery fleet


As a CONSTRUCTION MACHINERY MECHANIC in WESTENDE, you can identify yourself with the following requirements:

• You have experience as a maintenance technician working on construction machinery and/or trucks;
• You have a good command of Dutch or English;
• You have a valid category B driving licence;
• You have a strong interest in and passion for technology and mechanics, with knowledge of hydraulic and pneumatic systems.

